:: Carter Pool Swimming Basic Splash [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are hanging about in the pool, floating and playing around, when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, unintentionally or otherwise, splashes you pretty hard. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whoops, haha.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs. You glare at him with a smirk, splashing him back with just as much force. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, you want a splash battle!?”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He responds as you both begin to splash each other wildly, your laughter filling the yard as you both try your best to cover your eyes and mouth while splashing the other.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>


Seeing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> as distracted, eyes closed as he splashes and his own laughter able to mask your sudden disappearance, <span style="color:LightGreen">you dive under the water to escape his attack and plan a sneaky offensive.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Pull him underwater<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You act fast, gripping <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s ankles and yanking him underwater!</span> You hear a muffled, faint scream of fear as you grab him that is quickly gagged as water fills his open mouth and he flails around in fear, surfacing a moment later as he coughs and gags up water. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No fair!”</span> He spits, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That was a villain move!”</span> You laugh, saying that if he is always the hero, then sometimes you gotta be a villain. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh yeah? Well, here’s what I do to villains!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">jumps onto you, pulling you both down into the water as you continue to play and splash about. It is pretty wholesome fun.</span> <br>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Poke his butt<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">With a devious, underwater grin, you swim up behind <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, looking at his cute, loose trunks from the back. He’s tied the drawstring pretty tight as to not lose them when getting in and out of the water. This makes it pretty easy to find the center of his butt as you put both of your hands together, making a point with your index and middle fingers, and shoving it directly into his rear like you’ve seen done on TV. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Eeeepp!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> lets out a high pitched squeal as he is practically lifted out of the water by your poke, confident your fingers shoved his trunks right up against his little boy hole! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> flails about in surprise and confusion as you surface, gasping for air in between laughs.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Swim",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                        Arms: "Bound",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
        
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no fair!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:Pink">blushes, holding his backside,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Butt stuff is off-limits! That’s- that’s villain behavior!”</span> You laugh, saying that if he is always the hero, then sometimes you gotta be a villain. <span style="color:Pink">And villains LOVE going for the hero’s weakest point!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh yeah? Well, here’s what I do to villains!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> jumps onto you, pulling you both down into the water as you continue to play and splash about. <span style="color:Pink">Though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is careful to keep his butt away from you.</span> <br>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
